cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: neuro-embedding
abstract: 'Low-dimensional population embeddings of neural activity aligned with behaviour by neuro-align: PCA and
  factor analysis, GPFA (elephant), and CEBRA-Time / CEBRA-Behavior with a shuffled-label control, goodness of fit,
  and consistency across sessions; 3-D embedding figures (PNG and interactive HTML) and the embeddings as npz.'
